{"id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure.md","title":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Closure","display":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","aliases":["14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure"],"display":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Closure","depends_on":["[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为固定初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为 Lawvere–Tierney 拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:X\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\chi_A:X\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 是子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一特征箭头；它由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a> 的代表等价确定。子对象序及运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_j\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_j\\)</span> 在本条绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\exists!B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ (\\chi_B=j\\circ\\chi_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\exists!B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ (\\chi_B=j\\circ\\chi_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ (\\chi_B=j\\circ\\chi_A)\\qquad(A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ (\\chi_B=j\\circ\\chi_A)\\qquad(A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\bigl(A\\leq_X\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_j(\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A))=\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A\\wedge_X B)=\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\wedge_X\\mathrm{Cl}_j(B)\\bigr),\\qquad\\mathrm{Cl}_j(\\top_X)=\\top_X.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\bigl(A\\leq_X\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_j(\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A))=\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A\\wedge_X B)=\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\wedge_X\\mathrm{Cl}_j(B)\\bigr),\\qquad\\mathrm{Cl}_j(\\top_X)=\\top_X.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：V.1，印刷页 219–222。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述：任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to\\Omega\">\\(X\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 拉回真值箭头得子对象，分类子的唯一性保证同构类唯一，所以定义存在且单值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leq j(p)\">\\(p\\leq j(p)\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 所对应真值拉回后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\top)=\\top\">\\(j(\\top)=\\top\\)</span> 推得；另外三项分别来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^2=j\">\\(j^2=j\\)</span>、交保持和真值保持。此后闭包是子对象本身的函数，不仅是给其特征箭头改名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为固定初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 为 Lawvere–Tierney 拓扑，$X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。$\\chi_A:X\\to\\Omega$ 是子对象 $A$ 的唯一特征箭头；它由 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]] 与 [[14-df-subobjects]] 的代表等价确定。子对象序及运算见 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]、[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 在本条绑定的 $X$ 上解释。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","an