)\\ (\\chi_B=j\\circ\\chi_A)\\qquad(A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\bigl(A\\leq_X\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\land\\mathrm{Cl}_j(\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A))=\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A\\wedge_X B)=\\mathrm{Cl}_j(A)\\wedge_X\\mathrm{Cl}_j(B)\\bigr),\\qquad\\mathrm{Cl}_j(\\top_X)=\\top_X.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"X\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leq j(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"j(\\top)=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"j^2=j","display":false}],"bytes":2031,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure|Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Closure]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]"},{"id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$j$ 是 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]] 的 LT 拓扑；$m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，闭包见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]。"},{"id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$j$ 是 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]] 的 LT 拓扑；$m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，$[m]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$，闭包见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure|Definition — Lawvere–Tierney Closure]]"},{"id":"38500c05a94778d2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 为 LT 拓扑。将 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]] 的闭包显式记为 $\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}$，其定义域为 $\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$。$f:Y\\to X$ 为任意箭头，$m:A\\hookrightarrow B$ 为 $j$-稠密单射。下式定义闭子对象集合及函数 $R_m,T_m$；$v:D\\hookrightarrow A$ 是输入子对象 $[v]$ 的任意代表。所有子对象序、逆像和像使用本书内建定义。"},{"id":"8e769e1f3e412be1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j$ 为其选定分类子上的 LT 拓扑，$m:A\\hookrightarrow X$ 为 $\\mathcal E$ 中的单态射；j-闭包及稠密、闭见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]、[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]。"},{"id":"ddd71b28b9e13b9b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2b82e142840e429","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m,U_X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$。$A$ 是 $X$ 的任意子对象；$\\mathrm{Cl}_j$ 见 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]，$\\Rightarrow_X,\\vee_X$ 见 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]。"}],"outgoing":["1289398555ba3eed","4b8f9443a0ee72c6","d3923e299ec2ec5a","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","b51ff4f43221971d"]}